# purpose: precedence pairs the other m2 scenarios do not combine, and the close/withdraw/close dance.
# exercises: frozen + insufficient; frozen + non-positive; closed + non-positive; closed + insufficient;
#            CLOSE with money -> WITHDRAW to zero -> CLOSE; open -> close -> re-open rejected;
#            every ERROR variant interleaved with accepted lines.
OPEN m USD
OPEN n USD
DEPOSIT m 10
DEPOSIT n 10
FREEZE m
WITHDRAW m 100
WITHDRAW m -1
DEPOSIT m 0
BALANCE m
CLOSE m
UNFREEZE m
WITHDRAW m 100
CLOSE m
WITHDRAW m 10
CLOSE m
WITHDRAW m -1
WITHDRAW m 100
DEPOSIT m 5
OPEN m USD
OPEN m GBP
deposit n 1
DEPOSIT n 1
DEPOSIT n
DEPOSIT n 1
DEPOSIT N 1
DEPOSIT n 1
DEPOSIT n 1.001
DEPOSIT n 1
OPEN o eur
OPEN o EUR
DEPOSIT o 1
BALANCE n
FREEZE n
FREEZE n
UNFREEZE n
UNFREEZE n
WITHDRAW n 14
CLOSE n
WITHDRAW n 0.01
BALANCE n
BALANCE o
